  "problems": "The en_gb customer-service size guide URL now redirects to a FAQ saying the guide lives on product pages; the tables were read from the H&M Oman (hm.com/om) customer-service guide, H&M's own site. Letter sizes span two EU sizes each (XS = 32-34 ... 4XL = 60-62, header colspan 2). The general chart covers trousers too and gives one inside-leg value, 79 cm, for every size. The jeans table is only a conversion (waist-inch labels grouped per letter/EU pair, no measurements); exact inch-to-EU pairing inside each group is not published, so groups are stored as-is. Bust measurement listed as 'Bust (cm)', hip as 'Seat (cm)'. Product-page guides for specific markets were not cross-checked."
